OL,3,GNEWSABid to buy 'forgotten Einstein'
OL,4,Achurch hits purchase price
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community bid to buy a south of
OL,7,FScotland church with links to the man
OL,8,Fdescribed as "Scotland's forgotten
OL,9,FEinstein" has raised enough to meet its
OL,10,Fpurchase price.
OL,12,FVillagers in Parton only started their
OL,13,Ffundraising at the start of the month
OL,14,Fbut have already reached more than the
OL,15,F#50,000 agreed to acquire the building
OL,16,Ffrom the Church of Scotland.
OL,18,FScientist James Clerk Maxwell - whose
OL,19,Fwork paved the way for mobile phones,
OL,20,Fradio and television - is buried in the
OL,21,Fchurch graveyard.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
